      "encodingFormat": "text/csv",
      "includes": "*/*.csv",
      "description": "Raw ADS-B messages, one folder per day (MM-DD-YY), one or more CSVs per day. Columns: ID (ICAO 24-bit address as an integer), Time and Date (Python 2 list reprs, e.g. \"[u'07', u'00', u'01.08']\"), Altitude (ft), Speed (kt), Heading (deg), Lat, Lon, Age (s), Range (km from the receiver), Bearing (deg), Tail (broadcast callsign: the N-number for most general aviation, a flight number for airlines), AltisGNSS. The 2022 archives use Deflate64."
    },
    {
